WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.140 --> 01:31.240
Chocolat has safely returned
home from the Cocoa Desert.

01:31.890 --> 01:36.360
It seems that Amber gave her a surefire magic to remove black hearts.

01:36.980 --> 01:37.980
Is that so?

01:38.610 --> 01:40.700
I just hope it works.

01:41.570 --> 01:42.610
Vanilla...

01:46.450 --> 01:49.490
Noir and Tears of Friendship.

01:53.620 --> 01:57.000
I can use this to remove
the Noir inside Vanilla.

01:58.210 --> 01:59.970
I have to do my best.

02:00.420 --> 02:03.760
I'm the only one who can take Vanilla's black heart.

02:06.010 --> 02:07.800
What was that for?

02:09.390 --> 02:12.100
It's got sand in it from flying
through the desert...

02:13.520 --> 02:15.600
It's telling you to wash it clean.

02:19.020 --> 02:21.190
As if my morning wasn't
busy enough.

02:21.190 --> 02:22.740
I'm gonna be late!

02:23.360 --> 02:25.740
And I haven't even been
to school in a week.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.990
So hurry up and clean it.

02:30.580 --> 02:32.460
Fly like the wind!

02:36.660 --> 02:37.500
What's that?

02:38.250 --> 02:40.000
Noir is overflowing...

02:40.460 --> 02:43.800
I bet there's black hearts
all over the school.

02:44.550 --> 02:46.970
Did Vanilla do this?

02:49.010 --> 02:50.010
It's true.

02:50.010 --> 02:51.820
There's a ton of black hearts.

02:55.730 --> 02:58.980
I wonder if my classmates'
hearts are black, too.

03:00.150 --> 03:01.200
Chocolat!

03:02.230 --> 03:03.320
Are you okay?

03:04.610 --> 03:06.290
We heard you had a terrible cold.

03:06.570 --> 03:09.360
So I was gone because of a "cold"...

03:09.360 --> 03:11.780
Robin covered for me.

03:12.280 --> 03:13.330
Kato!

03:13.330 --> 03:15.450
You feeling better?

03:15.450 --> 03:17.000
Huh? Oh, yeah.

03:17.000 --> 03:19.500
My day just
isn't complete without...

03:19.500 --> 03:21.710
a threat of
butt-whupping from you.

03:22.290 --> 03:25.500
I'm so glad they're all normal...

03:33.180 --> 03:34.010
Vanilla!

03:35.810 --> 03:36.680
What is it?

03:36.680 --> 03:38.390
What business do you have
with Vanilla-sama?

03:39.060 --> 03:41.240
I need to talk with her.

03:41.810 --> 03:43.440
Vanilla. You and me.

03:43.440 --> 03:45.690
After classes.
Behind the school.

03:45.690 --> 03:47.570
I have something
important to tell you.

03:48.860 --> 03:49.860
Please!

03:59.040 --> 04:01.920
Vanilla... is she all right?

04:03.250 --> 04:05.880
But, if I can remove
her black heart,

04:05.880 --> 04:07.590
the pain should go away.

04:09.760 --> 04:10.630
Vanilla!

04:14.140 --> 04:16.220
So, there was
something "important"?

04:16.220 --> 04:17.770
Oh, it's important all right.

04:17.770 --> 04:20.350
I went to the Cocoa Desert and
met a witch named Amber,

04:20.350 --> 04:22.400
who knew my mother.

04:22.400 --> 04:24.400
And while I was there...

04:25.230 --> 04:30.190
Amber showed me some magic
that can remove black hearts.

04:31.150 --> 04:32.530
Is that it?

04:33.280 --> 04:35.660
Vanilla, you're still in pain, right?

04:36.240 --> 04:38.450
Let's get that black heart out
of you as soon as possible!

04:39.040 --> 04:40.000
Leave me alone.

04:40.660 --> 04:41.300
But...

04:42.000 --> 04:43.830
I'm fine the way I am.

04:44.540 --> 04:45.380
Vanilla!

04:48.550 --> 04:49.880
Vanilla, wait!

04:50.420 --> 04:53.880
Queen Candy is really
worried about you, too!

04:57.180 --> 05:00.520
Please, go back to the
way you were before!

05:05.650 --> 05:07.480
Don't worry about me anymore.

05:07.480 --> 05:09.860
That's what's making
my heart hurt!

05:10.320 --> 05:12.150
If it weren't for you,

05:12.650 --> 05:14.620
I could become the Ogre Queen...

05:14.910 --> 05:17.870
Just... let me be!

05:18.530 --> 05:19.410
Vanilla...

05:45.190 --> 05:46.480
Chocolat...

05:53.150 --> 05:54.900
Don't make Vanilla-sama cry!

05:57.160 --> 05:59.810
Stay away from Vanilla-sama,
you nobody!

06:02.750 --> 06:04.830
Black hearts of hatred...

06:06.620 --> 06:07.630
Ogres...

06:07.630 --> 06:09.840
I want Noir...

06:09.840 --> 06:11.420
Grow bigger...

06:17.260 --> 06:20.010
Chocolat, take those Ogres down!

06:20.510 --> 06:23.260
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

06:27.980 --> 06:29.130
Wand!

06:39.490 --> 06:40.870
Brille Etoile!

06:47.790 --> 06:48.890
What is...

06:48.890 --> 06:49.870
this chick doing?

06:50.500 --> 06:51.690
It's not working!

06:51.690 --> 06:54.380
That Noir is mine!

06:54.380 --> 06:55.630
No, it's mine!

07:03.430 --> 07:04.600
Congelation!

07:12.440 --> 07:13.730
Pierre...

07:14.320 --> 07:16.180
No independent actions.

07:16.940 --> 07:17.610
Leave.

07:21.740 --> 07:23.910
We must return to Vanilla-sama.

07:30.000 --> 07:31.630
Pierre...

07:31.630 --> 07:33.330
you saved me.

07:34.460 --> 07:35.800
Pierre...

07:37.800 --> 07:38.970
thank you!

07:43.100 --> 07:44.430
A pink heart?

07:48.680 --> 07:50.440
Am I seeing things?

07:52.270 --> 07:53.480
Or was that...?

08:06.040 --> 08:06.710
Pierre-sama.

08:08.660 --> 08:09.950
What is it, Juiliet?

08:10.710 --> 08:12.510
Vanilla-sama is in pain.

08:18.710 --> 08:20.130
Vanilla-chama...

08:27.060 --> 08:33.560
The Grand Duke of Darkness has suggested
that you remove Vanilla's original heart.

08:35.610 --> 08:36.310
What?

08:38.190 --> 08:40.650
Doing that will
put Vanilla at ease.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.570
Her pain stems from the strife...

08:43.570 --> 08:45.660
of the two hearts within her.

08:49.910 --> 08:52.370
This method is the only
remaining option.

08:59.710 --> 09:02.970
Do not go in alone to take
that black heart.

09:04.180 --> 09:06.430
If you play with
dark fire, Chocolat,

09:06.430 --> 09:07.970
you're going to get burned.

09:08.760 --> 09:11.140
But I couldn't take it at all.

09:11.140 --> 09:14.690
Is Vanilla that opposed to you
taking her black heart?

09:15.270 --> 09:15.900
Yeah.

09:16.770 --> 09:18.240
What do I do?

09:20.190 --> 09:21.690
I don't know.

09:25.490 --> 09:29.460
Chocolat, you need to focus on the
Queen Selection Exam now.

09:29.460 --> 09:31.950
But at this rate, Vanilla will...!

09:32.540 --> 09:34.910
Don't take Noir hearts lightly.

09:35.670 --> 09:37.670
Your very life could be endangered.

09:38.460 --> 09:39.600
Trust me, I know.

09:40.170 --> 09:44.420
You still need time to master
the magic Amber taught you.

09:44.970 --> 09:46.380
I can't wait any longer!

09:46.890 --> 09:49.650
You might end up taking
Vanilla's life.

09:50.310 --> 09:51.850
What if you do something...

09:51.850 --> 09:53.640
that can't be undone, Chocolat?

09:54.810 --> 09:55.690
Chocolat...

10:01.860 --> 10:03.990
We would always play together...

10:04.820 --> 10:06.570
in the backyard of Le Palais...

10:06.570 --> 10:09.220
near the strawberry bushes
by the milk stream.

10:10.490 --> 10:12.910
We cried, laughed, and got
angry with each other.

10:13.450 --> 10:16.410
I'm going to put my
classmates' hearts to use.

10:18.580 --> 10:22.340
I'm sure Vanilla's collected
all the colors.

10:27.300 --> 10:29.300
Time to go and convince
Vanilla, one more time.

10:30.300 --> 10:33.060
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

10:38.900 --> 10:40.980
Fly to Pierre's house!

11:00.130 --> 11:01.080
There it is.

11:12.470 --> 11:14.220
Ouvrir!

11:15.590 --> 11:17.480
Door, open!

11:19.190 --> 11:20.650
It's no use...

11:21.230 --> 11:23.650
So I have to blast this door
down with magic?

11:29.400 --> 11:31.200
Pierre's cat...

11:35.910 --> 11:38.000
A faint scent of chocolate...

11:39.120 --> 11:39.830
Can it be?!

11:53.240 --> 11:54.600
What's going on?

11:57.720 --> 12:00.310
Is something protecting me?

12:02.650 --> 12:04.110
This fragrance...

12:05.070 --> 12:06.480
It's cinnamon!

12:19.500 --> 12:20.580
It hurts...

12:21.500 --> 12:22.970
I can't breathe...

12:23.790 --> 12:25.210
Vanilla!!

12:25.210 --> 12:26.210
Chocolat?!

12:28.720 --> 12:31.670
Vanilla-chama is in such agony...

12:32.180 --> 12:34.050
Vanilla, are you all right?

12:37.470 --> 12:38.760
Chocolat-chan...?

12:44.730 --> 12:46.980
Why have you come here?

12:46.980 --> 12:48.940
I just had to save you.

12:50.070 --> 12:51.190
Save me?

12:52.700 --> 12:56.490
You looked like you were
suffering so much.

12:56.490 --> 12:58.290
If I don't remove that Noir soon,

12:58.290 --> 13:00.290
your body will give out.

13:00.290 --> 13:02.210
Go ahead, try and take it
if you think you can.

13:02.660 --> 13:04.250
You can't even touch it.

13:04.710 --> 13:06.420
Vanilla...

13:06.420 --> 13:07.170
Get out.

13:07.790 --> 13:09.170
I will call Pierre!

13:12.130 --> 13:13.050
Are these...

13:14.180 --> 13:15.340
raspberries?

13:15.890 --> 13:18.280
They've got a preservative
spell on them.

13:22.890 --> 13:24.240
Aren't these...

13:24.240 --> 13:26.690
the raspberries I gave
you awhile back?

13:27.190 --> 13:27.940
They are not...

13:43.290 --> 13:44.500
An orange heart...

13:45.040 --> 13:45.660
Stop it!

13:48.670 --> 13:49.720
It hurts...!

13:50.210 --> 13:51.000
Vanilla!

13:51.710 --> 13:52.460
Chocolat?

14:02.810 --> 14:05.120
Help me, Pierre!

14:05.730 --> 14:06.900
Vanilla!

14:06.900 --> 14:09.310
Having two hearts is
causing her pain.

14:09.310 --> 14:11.860
She'd be better off with
only the Noir.

14:14.190 --> 14:16.700
We just have to remove
the original heart.

14:17.280 --> 14:19.410
No, don't do it!

14:19.410 --> 14:21.200
Don't take her original heart!

14:22.490 --> 14:23.700
Do not interfere.

14:25.120 --> 14:26.130
Rafale!

14:28.630 --> 14:29.580
Chocolat-chan!

14:31.250 --> 14:32.210
Chocolat-chan...

14:32.210 --> 14:33.850
Chocolat-chan, are you okay?

14:38.210 --> 14:41.010
Vanilla... come back to me.

14:41.510 --> 14:42.560
Chocolat-chan?

14:44.770 --> 14:48.560
I'm so lonely without
you next to me...

14:49.020 --> 14:50.020
Chocolat-chan...

14:52.320 --> 14:54.900
I'm lonely without you too!

14:55.440 --> 14:58.460
I really wanted to stay
friends with you!

15:03.830 --> 15:04.680
Vanilla...

15:05.500 --> 15:08.660
Vanilla, can I take your black heart?

15:09.120 --> 15:12.250
The Great Witch Amber
said I'd be able to!

15:12.790 --> 15:16.550
But you're putting yourself
at risk by doing that.

15:17.300 --> 15:17.970
I'll be fine.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.010
Okay.

15:20.720 --> 15:23.030
Please do it, Chocolat-chan.

15:25.020 --> 15:26.470
Stop it, Chocolat!

15:26.470 --> 15:28.900
You can't take a Noir heart!

15:29.230 --> 15:31.520
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

15:31.520 --> 15:33.400
Noir, PICK UP!

15:41.410 --> 15:44.370
I just hope Amber's magic works...

15:48.330 --> 15:49.000
Chocolat!

15:51.000 --> 15:51.710
It hurts...!

15:52.250 --> 15:55.380
The Noir is entering my heart...

15:57.380 --> 15:59.420
What if I weren't a princess?

15:59.420 --> 16:01.260
What if I were plain Vanilla?

16:01.260 --> 16:03.970
Nobody would need me.

16:04.600 --> 16:08.520
That's why I have to study
hard and be a good girl.

16:09.250 --> 16:11.520
This is Vanilla's Noir...

16:12.480 --> 16:13.980
Vanilla's memories...?

16:14.730 --> 16:18.120
Vanilla, I'm gonna go play
with the other kids.

16:18.570 --> 16:21.030
Chlocolat-chan,
don't leave me alone!

16:22.910 --> 16:27.530
Chocolat-chan made friends as soon as we came to the Human World.

16:27.530 --> 16:30.120
But I don't know how to
talk to people here.

16:30.830 --> 16:32.330
Wait, Chocolat-chan!

16:32.330 --> 16:33.580
Don't leave me behind!

16:36.630 --> 16:37.960
I'm sorry...

16:37.960 --> 16:39.310
I'm so sorry, Vanilla!

16:39.880 --> 16:40.550
Chocolat...

16:41.170 --> 16:44.090
I wanted to get
along with Vanilla,

16:44.090 --> 16:46.480
but I wound up
hurting her so much.

16:46.930 --> 16:47.970
Vanilla!

16:49.310 --> 16:50.720
Chocolat-chan...

16:52.230 --> 16:53.100
Why?

16:53.100 --> 16:56.230
How can she be alive
with Noir inside her?

17:00.150 --> 17:01.400
Vanilla!

17:02.490 --> 17:04.360
Chocolat-chan, you're crying.

17:04.360 --> 17:05.570
Well so are you.

17:07.330 --> 17:08.500
I'm sorry, Vanilla!

17:10.450 --> 17:13.000
No. I'm at fault for always
relying on you.

17:13.830 --> 17:16.960
But from now on, I'll
be strong enough...

17:16.960 --> 17:20.140
that my heart will never
turn black again.

17:24.760 --> 17:27.260
It smells like Le Royaume
scum in here.

17:27.260 --> 17:29.390
Pierre-sama,
please open the door!

17:32.560 --> 17:33.560
It's her!

17:33.560 --> 17:34.600
Get her!

17:38.310 --> 17:41.400
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

17:44.200 --> 17:45.480
Wand!

17:46.280 --> 17:47.610
Blizzard of Bubbles!

17:51.490 --> 17:52.370
Vanilla...

17:55.580 --> 17:56.550
What have you done?

17:57.580 --> 17:59.210
Fleur Spirale!

18:04.300 --> 18:06.060
Chocolat, Vanilla!

18:10.220 --> 18:10.810
Go.

18:11.470 --> 18:12.770
Pierre...

18:13.310 --> 18:14.310
Chocolat-chan!

18:23.030 --> 18:24.400
What a...

18:24.400 --> 18:26.450
What a sad smile...

18:35.830 --> 18:38.510
He saved us, didn't he?

18:39.040 --> 18:39.960
Pierre...

18:43.300 --> 18:45.590
You flew into Pierre's
mansion on your own...

18:45.590 --> 18:47.340
and took her black heart?!

18:47.800 --> 18:49.840
So, what of the Noir?

18:49.840 --> 18:51.440
Right here in the holder.

18:52.060 --> 18:53.600
Want me to show you?

18:54.350 --> 18:55.680
No, don't do it!

18:55.680 --> 18:56.930
Robin-sensei...

18:57.480 --> 18:59.980
Seriously, this takes the cake.

19:00.770 --> 19:03.520
Handling Noir directly will
bring about your death.

19:03.520 --> 19:06.690
Come on, sprinkle some salt,
and get the candles.

19:10.780 --> 19:14.450
These preparations are necessary
for dealing with Noir.

19:26.710 --> 19:27.970
A pure white heart?

19:28.800 --> 19:31.470
It turned into Blanc while
Chocolat was carrying it.

19:32.510 --> 19:35.010
Meaning that...
it's been purified?

19:35.600 --> 19:37.270
Is she a Filtre?

19:37.270 --> 19:37.980
A "Filtre"?

19:38.810 --> 19:41.650
A Filtre is something that purifies.

19:41.650 --> 19:44.980
People who can purify Noir
appear from time to time.

19:47.080 --> 19:50.000
That's right, Cinammon
was also a Filtre.

19:50.700 --> 19:51.500
Mama was too...

19:51.820 --> 19:54.450
Chocolat Meilleure,
you are the only one...

19:54.450 --> 19:57.340
who can use this potion
to save Vanilla.

19:57.340 --> 20:00.960
So this is what Amber
was talking about.

20:01.460 --> 20:04.750
Anyway, I'm just glad
you're all right, Chocolat.

20:05.210 --> 20:07.420
And you too, Vanilla.

20:07.420 --> 20:11.180
I'm so sorry to have worried
you, Robin-sensei.

20:11.180 --> 20:15.220
Yeah, I was, but a certain someone
was even more worried.

20:18.060 --> 20:19.640
Queen Candy...

20:20.230 --> 20:23.150
My sincerest apologies,
Queen Candy.

20:23.770 --> 20:25.900
Vanilla, you have pulled through.

20:26.440 --> 20:29.820
Mama, I'm so sorry! I...

20:30.700 --> 20:33.610
But I'll be fine now,
Queen Candy.

20:36.160 --> 20:38.910
At last, the
Final Exams are upon us.

20:38.910 --> 20:42.370
Please give them your best
and most honest efforts.

20:42.920 --> 20:43.500
Yes.

20:44.080 --> 20:45.790
Furthermore, Chocolat...

20:47.000 --> 20:49.390
Thank you for saving Vanilla.

20:54.300 --> 20:57.370
I'm so glad you came back, Vanilla.

20:57.970 --> 21:01.230
I feel really bad about
worrying you, Chocolat-chan.

21:01.850 --> 21:06.350
Don't be, let's just do our best on
the Queen Final Exam, 'kay?

21:06.350 --> 21:06.740
Yeah.

21:07.440 --> 21:09.400
Whichever one of us
becomes Queen,

21:09.400 --> 21:11.360
we'll still be best friends,
won't we?

21:11.360 --> 21:13.000
Of course we will!

21:13.490 --> 21:17.120
It's so great that Vanilla-chama's
returned to normal.

21:17.700 --> 21:20.330
Were you lonely without me?

21:20.330 --> 21:21.950
Take a wild guess!

21:23.490 --> 21:25.000
More...

21:25.000 --> 21:26.540
Noir.

21:30.380 --> 21:33.340
The time of my
resurrection is at hand.

21:33.340 --> 21:34.240
And yet...

21:35.050 --> 21:39.010
You have failed to make
Vanilla the Ogre Queen.

21:39.680 --> 21:42.470
I have no excuse,
Grand Duke of Darkness.

21:43.270 --> 21:46.060
Did Cinnamon's daughter
get in the way?

21:48.810 --> 21:49.860
Pierre!

21:50.320 --> 21:50.950
Yes.

21:51.440 --> 21:54.190
The Magical World will
be ruled by the Ogres.

21:54.950 --> 21:58.570
I have entrusted the faith and
dreams of the Ogres to you.

21:58.570 --> 22:00.880
You must never forget this charge.

22:01.580 --> 22:02.240
Yes.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.080 --> 23:49.120
Chocolat-chan, the Queen Final Exam has arrived.

23:49.120 --> 23:54.070
The subject is, "Taking the horn of the only unicorn in the Magical World."

23:54.070 --> 23:57.460
Unicorns are extremely hard to handle.

23:57.460 --> 23:59.270
So you have to gently
call out to them.

23:59.270 --> 24:01.300
Hey, unicorn!

24:01.300 --> 24:04.110
